# 🏨 Luxury Hotel Menu UI

A modern *animated restaurant & hotel menu website* built using *HTML, CSS, and JavaScript*.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🍽️ 10+ Indian dishes with real images
- 🎬 Smooth animations + 3D flip cards
- 🌙 Luxury *dark hotel theme UI*
- 💰 Price filter system
- 🛒 Add to Cart functionality
- 📱 Fully responsive design

---

## 🚀 Live Demo

👉https://github.com/shakshisrivastava22872/FRONTEND_HOTEL_MENU

---



---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3 (Animations + 3D Effects)
- JavaScript (DOM + Filtering Logic)

